# TELLTALE

Stylometric analysis tool for detecting machine-generated text and evaluating stylistic patterns in written content.

## Overview

TELLTALE parses raw text to extract structural, lexical, and statistical markers. It measures sentence length variation, vocabulary density, and transitional syntax to identify signatures common in synthetic text.

## Features

* Sentence length variance and entropy measurement
* Lexical diversity and vocabulary richness calculations
* Repetitive syntax and phrase pattern matching
* Command-line batch execution for multiple input files
* Built with zero third-party dependencies

## Setup

```bash
git clone [https://github.com/theosintvault/TELLTALE.git](https://github.com/theosintvault/TELLTALE.git)
cd TELLTALE# TELLTALE

